.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class CELL = Element>
.br
class csmp::NumIntegral_BT_D_B_dV< dim, CELL >"
.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
S\&.K\&. Matthaei 

.PP
S\&. Roberts 
.RE
.PP
\fBDate\fP
.RS 4
1999 vector solution variable: stiffness matrix with 2(2D) or 3(3D) nodal degrees of freedon
.RE
.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
special case: if nu=0\&.5 a purely viscous (incompressible) fluid is modeled this requires a special material property matrix, see Zienkiewicz Vol II 
.RE
.PP

